sentences.l:
When early-born appeared, rose-fingered Dawn,
both the horses they yoked, and up onto the inlaid chariot they stepped,
and out they drove from the forecourt and the loud-echoing portico;

Not me past the ship drive, Zeus-nurtured one, but leave (me) right here,
lest me the old man, unwilling, hold back in his own house,
eager to welcome (me);

he turned the horses to the swift ship and the shore of the sea,
and in the ship, at the stern, took out the fair gifts,
the clothing and the gold, which Menelaus gave him;

what sort his spirit is, overweening: he will not let you go,
but himself, to summon you, here will come, and I say not that he
will go back empty;

and from close by there came to him a man,
from-a-far-land, fleeing out of Argos, having killed a man,
a seer;

but by birth he was a descendant of Melampus,
who once, formerly, lived in Pylos, mother of flocks,
rich among the Pylians, greatly, pre-eminently, dwelling in halls;
